	(text_box "Part: MX25R3235FZBIL0, 8-land USON 4 x 3 mm, ultra-low-power default mode, pin 7 = RESET#. VCC 1.65 to 3.6 V, so the 1.8 V rail is fine. 100 nF (C32) close to VCC, as the datasheet recommends." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 35.56 0) (size 100 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1d2cd6e0-d05a-4859-8973-a7c7ef2f9c23"))
	(text_box "SPI: mode 0 or 3. Up to 33 MHz for READ and 8 MHz for other commands in ultra-low-power mode, but the MAX86141 on the same bus allows only 4 MHz, so run the bus at 4 MHz or less while the MAX86141 is selected. SO is high impedance while CS# is high, so the bus can be shared (the MAX86141 SDO is also high impedance when CSB is high)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 46.76 0) (size 100 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c655cd11-bec3-4ed1-b872-52de92e25904"))
	(text_box "R18 pulls CS# to 1.8 V so the flash stays deselected while the processor pins float after reset (nRF54L15 errata 103) and during power-up and power-down (datasheet section 12)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 59.96 0) (size 100 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28c0af74-ba42-4496-b586-c297fd43179b"))
	(text_box "TP8 to TP10 are test points on the SPI clock, MOSI and MISO lines for the production fixture. WP# (pin 3) and RESET# (pin 7) are left open: both have an internal pull-up while not connected (datasheet section 3, note 1). Use the Reset command if a hardware reset is ever needed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 69.16 0) (size 100 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2acf40c-1a3a-4995-887f-06078d50caea"))
	(text_box "The two metal pads under the package must stay floating or go to ground only, with no vias or traces under them (datasheet section 19-4). Deep power-down is 0.35 uA maximum." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 82.36 0) (size 100 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a9d81874-88b7-48f6-a88d-f45cd4cb4044"))
	(text_box "Open item: land pattern 0.35 x 0.9 mm per pad is drawn from the package outline. Compare with the Macronix recommended land pattern before layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 91.56 0) (size 100 6.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38ac2848-3061-4f79-81e6-050baee0fe29"))
